  referenceImageName: Mural5
  displayName: Orbit
  location: Indoor hall wall below the mezzanine balcony
  physicalSizeMeters: {x: 6.4, y: 3.609}
  story: 'A bold figure stands against rays of teal, coral, black and white, with
    gold rings circling her head like a headdress and stacked bangles on her raised
    arms, while a second face watches from the right. The rings lift off the wall
    and orbit her in 3D, as if her crown were a small solar system.


    Tap the
    rings to spin them faster, or tap the bangles to send a pulse of light along
    the rays.'
